WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.780
Mount Hira, near Makkah,
in the month of Ramadan.

2
00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:08.110
A man of about 40 spends
his nights alone in a cave.

3
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.610
One night something happens there.

4
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:15.030
He comes home shaken, and asks his
wife to cover him with a cloak.

5
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.990
Within a few years, some of his followers
in that same city are being tortured.

6
00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.150
What happened that night, and how
did it turn Makkah against him?

7
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.800
In this mission, you'll read two short
passages Muslims link to that night.

8
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:31.260
Then you'll meet the first people he told,

9
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:34.090
and hear what one old man warned him.

10
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:39.240
Your mission: find out how one night
in a cave turned a city against him.
